        <inlineHelpText>• Intel Covered =  Accounts listed in annual account selection process of having Intel-led sales coverage 
• Indirect Covered = Accounts that are not Intel Covered &amp; ONLY have Design/Deal Registration opportunity within the last 5 years (and future)
• Not Covered =  Accounts with no Owner</inlineHelpText>
        <label>Account Primary Coverage</label>
        <required>false</required>
        <trackFeedHistory>false</trackFeedHistory>
