        <inlineHelpText>If checked, Contacts entitled to Resource &amp; Design Center (RDC) privileged access under this account have access to specifically targeted content, but are prevented from viewing standard CNDA content. For questions, use AAQ and select Access &amp; Entitlement</inlineHelpText>
